    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aSunken Dragon\u300bis a retro-style, turn-based Japanese RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring nostalgic pixel art paired with modernized controls, you\u2019ll guide the protagonist on a journey through this fantastical world. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet comrades who share your goals and form a party to adventure together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 characters in battle simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, branching storylines with extensive hidden content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 hours of main-story gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast world map filled with diverse villages and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable movement and battle speeds\u2014set your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of equipment and extended character progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit\u2013style graphics and soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aSunken Dragon\u300bis a retro-style, turn-based Japanese RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring nostalgic pixel art paired with modernized controls, you\u2019ll guide the protagonist on a journey through this fantastical world. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet comrades who share your goals and form a party to adventure together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 characters in battle simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, branching storylines with extensive hidden content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 hours of main-story gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast world map filled with diverse villages and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable movement and battle speeds\u2014set your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of equipment and extended character progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 8-bit\u2013style graphics and soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a retro 8-bit pixel-style RPG. The game features turn-based combat, inviting players to explore the unknown in a fantastical world.",
